WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.840
This is so fun!

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:09.480
What should we do next?

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.110
Right, Haruitsuki?

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:16.370
Hey, Yahiko.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:17.740
What?

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:21.450
Don't you want to go to the Underworld?

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:22.620
Huh?

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.750
There are more people for 
you to play with there.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.130
Wouldn't you be happier in—

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.620
Haruituski, do you want me to leave?

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:39.220
Do you not want to play with me anymore?

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:47.980
No, I still do.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.490
Great!

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:58.370
Then let's play some more, Haruitsuki!

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:00.440
Let's play hide-and-seek next!

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:36.260
<b>Mystery 8 "The Wait"</b>

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:36.260
Is it true that you wanted to be 
the master, so you killed Aoi?

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:41.260
Zenko, are you okay?

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:42.190
Zen—

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:46.630
<i>This is that feeling I got when I was 
possessed by a yokai before...</i>

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:50.310
Did you not want to be an employee forever?

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:52.250
If you're the master,

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.840
no matter what evils you 
commit, you're not punished.

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:58.620
The yokai call you "master," as well.

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:02.360
And it pays well, too.

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:08.090
Are you jealous?

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:09.830
It's true.

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:12.920
The master of the Mononokean is special.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:18.440
There are yokai who envy the status 
and prestige granted by the title.

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:21.620
But as far as I'm concerned, those things

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:24.140
are no more than a burden.

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:25.340
Besides,

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:31.050
I killed Aoi so I could 
become the master, you say?

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:38.150
So that's what the yokai say about me.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:45.930
If Aoi had heard that rumor,

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:48.540
they'd have clutched their 
stomach and laughed.

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:53.340
Yahiko, I didn't kill Aoi.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:54.790
I...

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:59.420
I've never wished for Aoi 
to die and disappear.

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:01.940
Not for a second.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.620
Zenko? Oh, good.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:09.160
You're not dead? You're not dead?

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:11.680
Was I dead?

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.340
You're alive!

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:19.900
Haruitsuki, you know...

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:25.950
When I heard the rumors, I didn't believe 
they were true in the slightest.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:28.080
Not until I saw you.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:28.870
Me?

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.470
Well, yeah. You've grown taller,

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:34.380
and your face and voice are more mature now.

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:37.880
You were no longer the Haruitsuki I knew.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.840
I wasn't so sure anymore.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:43.290
That's why I wanted to make 
sure you hadn't changed.

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:47.680
But after playing together today, I know.

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:50.930
You're still the Haruitsuki I know.

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:52.770
I don't doubt you anymore.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:54.440
All the rumors are lies.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:58.730
Yahiko, what were you 
planning to do if that rumor

00:04:58.730 --> 00:04:59.940
turned out to be true?

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:03.440
Who knows? It would depend 
on how I felt at the time.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.670
Zenko, can you stand?

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:08.120
Yeah.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.700
Does your mark still hurt? Are you injured?

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:11.530
No.

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:14.330
Yahiko.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.650
What?

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:17.630
I don't really mind this.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.640
I'm used to dealing with yokai.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:22.960
But the others are different.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:25.130
Haruitsuki?

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:28.500
Don't think that just 
removing the mark is enough

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:32.230
to get us to forgive you for 
what you put Zenko through.

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:33.150
Huh?

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:41.340
Zenko, is the mark gone? Let me see.

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:42.940
It's gone.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.110
That's great!

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:45.290
Yahiko.

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:48.610
I know. I'll say it.

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:52.370
Uh, Zenko... sama.

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:59.380
I'm very sorry for the trouble I caused you.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:05.660
I swear to you that I'll never 
do anything like this again.

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:08.680
If it would make you feel better,

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:13.420
you're welcome to boil me or... uh...

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:15.960
It's "roast me alive or 
whatever else you please."

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:17.500
Start again from the beginning.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.060
No, that's okay.

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:21.650
She said it's okay, Haruitsuki.

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.760
That didn't sound sincere.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:24.810
One more time.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:28.080
Haruitsuki, you're scarier 
than you used to be.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.610
I'm very sorry for...

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:30.890
Hey, Yahiko.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.790
You don't need to apologize.

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:36.040
But will you do me a favor?

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.280
A favor?

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:40.570
I want you to help around 
the temple for a month.

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:42.320
Help around the temple?

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:43.040
Yeah.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.750
Wait a minute!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.640
Zenko, you're going to keep Yahiko here?

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.100
Yeah. I can't?

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:51.960
It's not that you can't, but...

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:53.560
Yahiko.

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:54.770
What?

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:56.750
I told you eight years ago.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:59.690
The Underworld has more 
people for you to play with.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:04.940
What do you want to do? 
Shall I send you to the Underworld?

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:12.810
Do you want me to leave?

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:17.120
Because I doubted you and tested you,

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:20.210
do you not want to play with me anymore?

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:27.270
I still do.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.220
Good!

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:34.140
In that case, instead of 
going to the Underworld,

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:35.970
I'll help around the temple for a year.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:38.460
What? Is that okay, Abeno-san?

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:41.260
One month turned into a year.

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:42.650
Behave yourself.

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:43.800
Okay!

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.860
In any case, I'm glad I got to go home.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:55.770
Hey, this is right around 
where I first met Fuzzy.

00:07:58.150 --> 00:08:00.370
What is this? A bird?

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:02.620
No, it's not a bird.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:04.730
A stuffed animal?

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.440
<i>Wait, this turn of events...</i>

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:08.630
<i>I remember this.</i>

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:12.220
<i>Based on how this is going, this must be...</i>

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.760
<i>I knew it!</i>

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:19.260
You made eye contact with me.

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:20.890
You can see me.

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.080
<i>I stepped on a yokai again!</i>

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:24.540
You!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:29.660
Do you know where the Mononokean is?

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:30.570
Huh?

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.780
The princess and I...

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.910
<i>Did he just say "Mononokean?"</i>

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:39.340
We must be exorcised...

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:41.620
Are you okay?

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:43.590
W-Water...

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:45.870
I need water...

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.840
Princess!

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.850
I'm sorry! I fell asleep!

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:54.380
Huh? Oh, I'm at home.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:55.720
I dozed off.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:57.610
Where am I?

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.650
A h-human?!

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:03.020
Who are you?

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:06.700
Do you not remember collapsing?

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:10.410
You're human, but you can see me?

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:12.090
Who are you?

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:15.280
I work at the Mononokean.
My name is Ashiya.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:18.080
Y-You're an employee of the Mononokean?!

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:19.450
Then you must

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:22.300
take me to the Mononokean immediately!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.080
W-Water...

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.580
Is tea okay?

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.700
Another.

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:35.030
You sure can drink.

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:36.760
This is your fifth cup.

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.830
You certainly saved me.

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:42.080
And how fortunate that you're 
an employee of the Mononokean.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.770
What a fantastic coincidence.

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:45.890
My name is Jomatsu.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:48.360
Jomatsu-san, before you lost consciousness,

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:50.610
you mentioned something about a princess.

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:53.610
I was referring to Princess 
Anmo, whom I serve.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:54.860
Princess Anmo?

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.280
She is very beautiful.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.240
Long before I began serving her,

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:02.470
she was adored by other 
yokai and dubbed a princess.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:06.240
But the princess falls in love so easily.

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:09.880
And her partners have always 
been of the mundane world.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:12.730
She's loved five humans, fifteen birds,

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:15.070
four bears, three raccoon dogs, 
two flying squirrels,

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:17.600
and countless dogs and cats.

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:19.790
Also, a jet.

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:21.010
She's not very picky!

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:24.480
She really does fall in love easily.

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:27.080
What troubles me most is what happens after.

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:32.940
Creatures of the mundane world 
can't see or hear yokai,

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:35.780
so her romances always end in heartbreak.

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:40.060
And when her heart is broken, 
she has an unfortunate habit

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:42.990
of creating an egg-shaped 
shell and holing up inside it.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:44.840
An egg shell?

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:49.970
Yes. Normally, she breaks the shell 
and comes out after a few days,

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:52.670
but this time she hasn't 
come out even after a month.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:56.420
On top of that, the shell seems 
to be getting larger every day.

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:58.120
Larger?

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:02.660
I'm not strong enough to 
move it around by myself.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.410
I am useless...

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:10.200
Please, Ashiya! Take me to the Mononokean!

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:13.610
Oh, sorry. I don't where 
the Mononokean is, either.

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:14.860
You don't know?!

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:16.660
Abeno-san...

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:19.640
The master of the Mononokean 
has to summon it.

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:21.830
I'll at least contact him.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:23.770
But you should take it easy tonight.

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:25.500
Very well.

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:29.640
Then contact him immediately! Right now!

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:30.870
Yeah, okay...

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:33.280
I wonder if Abeno-san will answer his phone.

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:35.180
Keep calling until he does!

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:36.750
I'll do my best.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:38.760
Hey.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.060
You have something on your head.

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:45.890
I called you over and over last night 
about this. Why didn't you answer?

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.220
Are you the master of the Mononokean?

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:50.040
Yes. Who are you?

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.140
I'm called Jomatsu.

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:54.350
He's asking to be exorcised.

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:57.360
If you can wait until after 
I finish today's job, I can help.

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:59.400
Otherwise, it'll have to be next week.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:00.610
Today! Today!

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.440
Do we have work today?

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:04.570
I'm just going to hear what the client wants.

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:08.160
I should be finished by this evening.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.980
<i>Is that our next job?</i>

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:14.230
I see... Evening, you say?

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:15.340
Princess...

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:17.500
Oh, hey, Jomatsu-san.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:21.810
Should we go see Princess Anmo 
first and wait for him there?

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:23.920
Wouldn't that be better 
than just sitting around?

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:27.530
Ah, great idea! Let's do that!

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:28.660
Ashiya...

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:32.560
You're going by yourself?

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:35.000
<i>He looks really uneasy.</i>

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:38.190
Let us go, then! To the princess!

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.160
Jomatsu-san, wait!

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:42.300
Stop! U-turn!

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:44.100
Hey...

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:48.380
Abeno-san, what should we do?

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:50.120
What? It's not my problem!

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.950
Do something about it yourself!

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:56.960
<b>The Morose Mononokean</b>

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:01.020
Wait! Jomatsu-san!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:03.390
You're too slow, Ashiya!

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:06.220
Please don't fly off on your 
own like you did this morning!

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:08.620
Hurry! Hurry up!

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:10.100
Y-You're so impatient!

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.400
The princess may come out of her shell

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:15.240
if she hears we'll be able 
to go to the Underworld.

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:18.730
I might get to see the princess 
for the first time in a month.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.560
<i>For someone so impatient,</i>

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:22.730
<i>he's very patient with the princess.</i>

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:25.340
Oh!

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:27.550
Wh-What?

00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:29.740
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:34.220
Now I'm even more curious. What is it?

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:36.250
I don't really want to ask...

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:38.020
Hurry up and say it.

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:40.670
O-Okay, then. I'll ask.

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:41.500
Jomatsu-san,

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:43.960
you love Princess Anmo, don't you?

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:48.560
Wh-Wh-What an idiotic accusation!

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:50.490
D-D-D-Don't get the wrong idea!

00:13:50.490 --> 00:13:53.650
I see. I guess I was mistaken.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:54.540
Let's go!

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:57.390
<i>He totally loves her.</i>

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:59.650
<b>Green Park</b>

00:13:58.720 --> 00:13:59.650
Princess!

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:02.890
Princess! Princess!

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:06.480
I thought I left her under this tree.

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:08.190
What does the egg look like?

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:11.410
It's larger than me and covered in stripes.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:15.330
If it's that small, I'll have to 
be careful not to step on—

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:17.310
Benkei!

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:19.380
What? Benkei?

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:22.600
I hit my shin on a rock...

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:24.210
A rock?

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:31.240
Is this a rock?

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:33.960
P-Princess!

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:35.390
Princess!

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:39.690
The shell grew so much bigger while I was gone!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.610
This is the egg?

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.240
Princess, can you hear me?

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:47.860
I found the Mononokean.
Now we can go to the Underworld!

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:50.520
Princess...

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:53.690
It doesn't look like she's coming out.

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:57.910
This should be small enough to pass 
through the portal to the Underworld.

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:01.790
It's so heavy.

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:05.750
Transporting it like this might be hard.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:08.260
I see...

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:10.520
Huh?

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:12.990
Jomatsu-san...

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:16.350
Can I break the egg?

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:17.360
What?!

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:20.190
The shell is like sand. It's surprisingly fragile.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:22.270
I could probably break it 
if I hit it with a rock.

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:24.520
I won't let you do anything so dangerous!

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:25.930
It's dangerous?

00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:28.200
Will it release poison gas or something?

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:32.200
What will I do if a broken shard 
strikes the princess and hurts her?

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:35.240
Besides, if you break it, she'll 
peck us over and over again!

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:37.280
<i>So he's been pecked before.</i>

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:38.350
Princess,

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:42.950
I will prevent any such action 
from being taken, so don't worry!

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:44.670
Hey, Jomatsu-san...

00:15:44.970 --> 00:15:48.940
Can Princess Anmo hear us?

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:52.000
Yes. Sometimes she responds,

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.430
so I think she can hear us.

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:55.900
Then that makes things easy!

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:00.670
Hello? Princess Anmo, can you hear me?

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:02.430
I work for the Mononokean.

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:04.380
Sorry to bother you during 
this difficult time,

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:07.480
but I can't send you to the Underworld 
while you're inside your shell.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.070
Will you come out of your shell?

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:17.200
Hey! Can you hear me?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.080
Stop! What if it breaks?

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:22.900
She ignored me.

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:24.320
It can't be helped.

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:26.650
I'll have to give up on 
going to the Underworld

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:29.230
and wait until the Princess comes out.

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:30.350
You're going to wait?

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:31.050
Yes.

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:35.270
You're going to wait, huh?

00:16:36.230 --> 00:16:37.930
But...

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.810
What? Ashiya?

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:41.980
This may be a little forceful...

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:43.020
Ashiya?

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:46.010
But if you're going to wait, 
let's just break it instead.

00:16:46.010 --> 00:16:48.680
What? I said I wouldn't let you!

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:49.720
Get rid of that rock!

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:52.540
You're too soft on Princess 
Anmo, Jomatsu-san!

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:54.830
You need to harden your heart a little!

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:56.800
What's gotten into you, Ashiya?!

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:58.430
Move, Jomatsu!

00:16:58.430 --> 00:16:59.820
If you don't move, you'll get hurt!

00:16:59.820 --> 00:17:02.400
Don't be absurd! I won't let 
you commit such a rash act!

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:04.960
If you keep humoring the Princess's
moods, this will never end!

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:06.520
I can wait as long as I have to!

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:09.500
Well, I can't leave until I do my job!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:11.340
Abeno-san will hit me!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:14.060
If you hurt the princess, I'll hit you!

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:16.940
Get out of the way, you...

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:19.870
Jomatsu-san, I'm sorry!

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:21.960
I didn't actually mean 
to hit you with the rock!

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:32.200
Jomatsu-san?

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:42.420
Princess!

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:46.660
Princess Anmo, sorry for scaring you.

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:49.460
Jomatsu-san is fine. See?

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:54.810
She went back inside!

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:56.480
So you were trying to

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:59.710
trick the princess into coming 
out with your cheap acting?!

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:01.470
How impertinent!

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:03.760
I knew it was forceful,

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:05.850
but I figured it'd be better than waiting.

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:09.990
Hey, Princess Anmo.
You can hear me, can't you?

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:14.380
You came out because you were 
worried about Jomatsu-san, right?

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:17.590
I'm worried about Jomatsu-san, too.

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:21.920
He might push himself too hard 
and collapse on the roadside again.

00:18:22.640 --> 00:18:24.830
I didn't push myself too hard!

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:27.270
Don't say that in front of the princess!

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:30.880
Well...

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:33.510
What did Princess Anmo say?

00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:39.520
"Wh-Why are you willing 
to go that far for me?"

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:41.530
<i>Because you love her, right?</i>

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:45.820
Jomatsu-san, this is your 
chance to confess to her.

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:50.250
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:51.930
Don't play dumb.

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:53.900
Watching you is starting 
to make me feel impatient.

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:57.330
Didn't the princess ask why because she has

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:59.160
some idea of how you feel?

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:01.030
R-Really?

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.950
P-Princess!

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:06.520
I-I...

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:07.410
I...

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:11.790
L-L-L-

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:15.100
Love... it.

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:20.630
I love flying in the sky with 
you more than anything else!

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:25.740
Because I look forward to flying with you,

00:19:25.740 --> 00:19:28.060
I can wait as many days as it takes.

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:33.640
S-So even after we go to the Underworld, I...

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:39.690
I hope you'll let me stay by your side forever.

00:19:40.870 --> 00:19:43.850
<i>He went beyond a confession. 
That was a proposal!</i>

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:45.740
<i>It was probably unintentional, though.</i>

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:53.300
Wh-What? B-But... That's absurd!

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:02.550
P-Princess...

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:05.600
I had no idea you felt the same way.

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:08.770
S-Steam?

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:10.560
A-Ashiya,

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:14.090
do... do you have water?

00:20:14.090 --> 00:20:15.900
I have oolong tea in my bag.

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:16.810
Ashiya.

00:20:17.590 --> 00:20:19.690
Abeno-san, you're already here?

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:22.700
If you didn't want me to come yet, I'll leave.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:25.320
No, this is good timing!

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:28.310
There's another one.

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:31.230
This is Princess Anmo.

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:33.020
The one holed up inside the egg?

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:35.710
Princess Anmo came out of her shell.

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:38.080
Now we just have to send 
them to the Underworld.

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:42.090
<i>That's the smug expression of someone 
who solved a problem by himself.</i>

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:44.090
How infuriating.

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:44.890
Huh?

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:49.850
Wh-Wha...

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:01.110
<i>Princess Anmo locked on to Abeno-san?!</i>

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:03.290
What's going on?

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:06.950
Didn't you and the princess just 
confess your love for each other?

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:13.000
The princess told me she also loves 
flying with me more than anything else.

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:18.430
She also said she'd try not to 
hide in her shell anymore...

00:21:18.430 --> 00:21:21.070
This is no time to be bashful!

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:22.510
Is the princess dense, too?

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:25.440
That's not what you meant by "love"!

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:27.240
Oh, come on!

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:28.090
Huh? What's wrong?

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:30.670
Abeno-san, don't act like 
this doesn't concern you!

00:21:30.670 --> 00:21:33.430
You're a part of this love triangle now!

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:36.320
What did I do in the two or 
three minutes since I got here?

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:40.110
I thought they'd get an Underworld 
honeymoon and a happy ending!

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:42.660
You came at the wrong time, Abeno-san!

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:43.190
Huh?

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:47.960
<i>Everything I do today is turning out badly.</i>

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:49.620
<i>Both this job...</i>

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:54.220
<i>and the next one.</i>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next Time "The Marked Difference"</b>

00:23:25.930 --> 00:23:28.160
He's loud and childish.

00:23:28.160 --> 00:23:30.270
I thought he was frank, 
but he's really just precocious.

00:23:30.270 --> 00:23:32.090
Huh? What's wrong, Ashiya?

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:33.400
Reflecting on your own flaws?

00:23:33.400 --> 00:23:35.930
I'm not talking about me. 
I'm talking about Yahiko!

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:37.560
Well, you're both on the same level.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:39.060
What do you mean by "level"?
